{"id":684,"date":"2026-08-16T07:29:27","date_gmt":"2026-08-16T07:29:27","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/?post_type=knowledgebase&#038;p=684"},"modified":"2026-08-16T10:50:46","modified_gmt":"2026-08-16T10:50:46","slug":"inserting-editing-text-boxes","status":"publish","type":"knowledgebase","link":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/db\/typography\/inserting-editing-text-boxes\/","title":{"rendered":"Inserting &#038; Editing Text Boxes"},"content":{"rendered":"<div style=\"color: #2b2b2b;\">\n<h2 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Inserting &amp; Editing Text Boxes<\/span><\/h2>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-687\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-16-072857.png\" alt=\"How to Insert a Text Box\" width=\"427\" height=\"249\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-16-072857.png 804w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-16-072857-300x175.png 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-16-072857-768x448.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 427px) 100vw, 427px\" \/><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">Text boxes are the primary container for all written content in Open Publisher.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">How to Insert a Text Box<\/span><\/h3>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Go to the <strong>Insert<\/strong> ribbon tab and click <strong>Text Box<\/strong>, or press <strong>T<\/strong> while the canvas is focused.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Click and drag on the canvas to draw the text box at the desired size.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">The cursor automatically enters editing mode, allowing you to begin typing immediately.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p class=\"western\">To edit an existing text box, double-click it. The box enters editing mode, the floating toolbar appears above it, and the <strong>Text Box Tools<\/strong> contextual ribbon activates at the top of the screen. To exit editing and return to selection mode, press Escape or click anywhere outside the text box.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">The Typography Ribbon<\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">When a text box is active, the Text Box Tools ribbon and the floating toolbar both give you access to a fully modernised set of typography controls. The font family and font size selectors use custom styled inputs with solid teal control blocks, hover highlights, and precision-aligned icons &#8211; consistent across the main Home tab and all contextual text toolbars.<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-691\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-16-073043.png\" alt=\"The Typography Ribbon\" width=\"815\" height=\"174\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-16-073043.png 1452w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-16-073043-300x64.png 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-16-073043-1024x219.png 1024w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-16-073043-768x164.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 815px) 100vw, 815px\" \/><\/p>\n<p><!-- PLACEHOLDER FOR NANO BANANA SCREENSHOT: TYPOGRAPHY RIBBON --><\/p>\n<p class=\"western\">When you close a contextual tab (such as Picture Tools or Drawing Tools), the ribbon intelligently returns to whichever standard tab you were on previously &#8211; not always the Home tab &#8211; so your workflow is never interrupted.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Font Controls<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-693\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-16-073158.png\" alt=\"Font Controls\" width=\"417\" height=\"158\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-16-073158.png 848w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-16-073158-300x114.png 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-16-073158-768x291.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 417px) 100vw, 417px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">Use the Font group on the Home ribbon or the floating toolbar to change:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Font Family:<\/strong> Choose from all system and Google Fonts available.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Font Size:<\/strong> Type directly into the size box, use the up\/down spinner arrows, or use keyboard shortcuts to nudge.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Text Colour:<\/strong> Opens the OS colour picker with a live preview that updates the canvas in real time as you drag the colour wheel.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Highlight Colour:<\/strong> Applies a coloured background highlight to selected text.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- PLACEHOLDER FOR NANO BANANA SCREENSHOT: FLOATING TOOLBAR --><\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-698 size-full\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-16-073630-e1786865878899.png\" alt=\"Font Controls (float)\" width=\"656\" height=\"237\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-16-073630-e1786865878899.png 656w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-16-073630-e1786865878899-300x108.png 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 656px) 100vw, 656px\" \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Inserting &amp; Editing Text Boxes Text boxes are the primary container for all written content in Open Publisher. How to Insert a Text Box Go to the Insert ribbon tab and click Text Box, or press T while the canvas is focused. Click and drag on the canvas to draw the text box at the [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":701,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","template":"","knowledgebase_cat":[11],"class_list":["post-684","knowledgebase","type-knowledgebase","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","knowledgebase_cat-typography"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/684","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/knowledgebase"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=684"}],"version-history":[{"count":9,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/684\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":704,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/684\/revisions\/704"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/701"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=684"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"knowledgebase_cat","embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase_cat?post=684"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}